ing  noodles are nice and tight don't let any  leakage come through another thing that  I love is clean layers so when  assembling the lasagna ring try to make  sure your meat layer is super smooth  you're leveling your lasagna slices and  you're also making the cheese filling  also very smooth because when you want  to cut it at the end you don't want to  just kind of explode everywhere you want  to cut through you want to see these  great alternating layers between meat  sauce ricotta and meat sauce I think it  looks really pretty  it's funny because I was making this by  myself really late at night and I was  like it's just gonna work it was just me  in the studio nobody else and I'd never  made it before by the time I was done it  was like 10 o'clock and the only people  around with the cleaning staff so I  wasn't sure how cool it was so I went up  to them I was like hey like do you think  this is really good one of the guys took  a bite he was like this is awesome so  super super cool and I was like alright  great they liked it I think we got a hit  one other thing that is really important  is that when it is finished baking  please let it cool I cannot stress this  enough because you know if you imagine  lasagna writer that comes out of the  oven it's really bubbly there's a lot of  stuff going on you want that to all  settle and absorb back in so make sure  you let it cool probably at least an  hour when you touch the side of the  bundt pan you want it to be slightly  warm so you can eat it but not cold not  too hot and trust me on this one you'll  enjoy it a lot later  you gotta put that little bowl of  marinara in the center because that's  kind of what seals it together and once  you kind of cut into it anybody can grab  it take a dip and that's pretty much it  you can use whatever meat sauce you want  if you have your own lasagna recipe do  whatever ricotta filling you want do  whatever meat sauce recipe you have just  make sure they're not too watery other  than that it's all up to you you guys  try it I want to see it posted in the  comments send me a picture let me see  how your lasagna ring turned out because  I think it's a really cool thing when  other people make my recipes so I always  love it when I can just see what you  make so yeah let me know send me a  picture we'll see how it goes okay  that's it  that's it for the lasagna  [Music]
 

